Product marks

The Control Deck shows the marks of Claude (Anthropic), Codex (OpenAI), Gemini
and Antigravity (Google), Grok (xAI) and OpenCode beside panes that run those
programs, only to say which program a pane runs. They are trademarks of their
owners. spandeck is not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by any of
them. The trademarks remain with their owners and their brand guidelines apply.

Claude, Gemini, OpenCode: the shapes are taken from Simple Icons
(https://simpleicons.org), which publishes them under CC0-1.0.

Codex, Grok, Antigravity: each shape is taken from its owner's own website,
fetched on 2026-11-14. These are not under an open licence. The path data is
copied as published and only scaled to the icon's size.

  Codex        https://chatgpt.com/cdn/assets/favicon-c80e01a96037.svg
               The icon of OpenAI's Codex page, https://chatgpt.com/codex: the
               OpenAI mark, which the Codex CLI also draws when it starts.
               Shown in white, the file's own colour for dark backgrounds.
  Grok         https://grok.com/images/favicon.svg
               The two shapes of the mark in the file's own colour (#FCFCFC).
               The dark tile the file puts behind them is left out, as is a
               hairline outline in the same colour.
  Antigravity  https://antigravity.google/assets/image/icons/sprite-icons.svg
               The symbol named "antigravity": Google's one-colour form of the
               mark, which that sheet draws in the colour of the text around
               it. Shown in the deck's light grey.

