Bundled fonts

crates/web/assets/fonts/SymbolsNerdFontMono-Regular-3.5.1.woff2 is "Symbols
Nerd Font Mono" from Nerd Fonts v3.5.1 (https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts,
the NerdFontsSymbolsOnly archive), unchanged except for being packed as WOFF2.
The Control Deck draws prompt icons and powerline signs from it on a device
that has no Nerd Font. Copyright (c) 2014 Ryan L McIntyre. MIT licence.

crates/web/assets/fonts/SpandeckPowerline-3.5.1.woff2 is made from the same
release (SymbolsNerdFont-Regular.ttf) by scripts/make-powerline-font.py: only
the powerline separators, U+E0B0 to U+E0D7, each scaled in width and height to
fit a terminal cell. Those glyphs are from Powerline Symbols and Powerline
Extra Symbols, both MIT, listed below.

The font is a collection of icon sets, each under its own licence. As listed
in the release's own README:

